## Third-party material

This guide synthesises published work by others. Where a framing, taxonomy, or
architecture is distinctly one author's, it is attributed in the relevant
chapter and listed in [docs/references.md](docs/references.md). Those
attributions are not covered by the licences above — the underlying works
remain the property of their respective authors, and the credit requirement
stands independently of how you use this guide.

If you believe something here is insufficiently attributed, please open an
issue; corrections are welcome and will be made promptly.

